# Copy to apps/bot/.dev.vars and edit privately. Never commit the filled file.
# Use a NEW BotFather test bot, never a production bot's credentials.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""
# Local helper safety check: your dedicated test bot's username, without @.
TELEGRAM_LOCAL_TEST_BOT_USERNAME=""
# Generate a fresh secret privately: e.g. 32 random bytes encoded as hex.
# Allowed characters: A-Z a-z 0-9 _ - (1–256 characters).
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
